<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling eases against dollar and pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling eases against dollar and pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling eased against the dollar and pound on Monday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The bank said the shilling traded at a commercial mean rate 593.6040 compared to Friday's mean of 592.5546. Against sterling, the shilling exchanged at 944.1302 compared to Friday's 937.6990.</p>
</text>
